  "phaseInfoFertilityDuration": "about 5 days, ending on ovulation",
  "phaseInfoFertilityBody": "the days when pregnancy is most likely (but pregnancy is also possible outside of this phase!). to show it on the calendar, turn on \"show higher-fertility window\" in settings.",
