  "phaseInfoLutealDuration": "about 12–14 days",
  "phaseInfoLutealBody": "progesterone rises after ovulation. towards the end, some people notice PMS symptoms such as bloating, mood changes or breast tenderness. this phase is fairly stable in length.",
